          "value": "I can see you're encountering an Android SDK configuration issue when trying to run your Expo app on Android. The error indicates that the Android SDK path cannot be resolved and `adb` (Android Debug Bridge) is not found. Let me help you set this up properly.\n\nFirst, let me check if you have Android SDK installed and help you configure the environment variables: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/home/junior/Projects/ecodreum/ecodreum-app/",
