          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "prepareToolInvocation",
          "toolName": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "kind": "toolInvocationSerialized",
          "invocationMessage": "Using \"Run In Terminal\"",
          "isConfirmed": true,
          "isComplete": true,
          "toolSpecificData": {
            "kind": "terminal",
            "language": "sh",
            "command": "which adb"
          },
          "toolCallId": "ab5ceb52-065e-46e2-a734-f1138837ac39",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "Let me check if Android SDK is installed in common locations: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/home/junior/Projects/ecodreum/ecodreum-app/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "prepareToolInvocation",
          "toolName": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "kind": "toolInvocationSerialized",
          "invocationMessage": "Using \"Run In Terminal\"",
          "isConfirmed": true,
          "isComplete": true,
          "toolSpecificData": {
            "kind": "terminal",
            "language": "sh",
            "command": "ls -la ~/Android/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"No ~/Android directory found\""
          },
          "toolCallId": "5618d948-689f-4eb4-8295-9f9b95cd26d2",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "Great! I can see you have the Android SDK installed at `~/Android/Sdk`. Let me check what's inside and verify the structure: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/home/junior/Projects/ecodreum/ecodreum-app/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "prepareToolInvocation",
          "toolName": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "kind": "toolInvocationSerialized",
          "invocationMessage": "Using \"Run In Terminal\"",
          "isConfirmed": true,
          "isComplete": true,
          "toolSpecificData": {
            "kind": "terminal",
            "language": "sh",
            "command": "ls -la ~/Android/Sdk/"
          },
          "toolCallId": "57830b9a-b858-4414-972b-92d59a4686e2",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "Perfect! The Android SDK is properly installed. Let me check if `adb` exists in the platform-tools directory: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/home/junior/Projects/ecodreum/ecodreum-app/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "prepareToolInvocation",
          "toolName": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "kind": "toolInvocationSerialized",
          "invocationMessage": "Using \"Run In Terminal\"",
          "isConfirmed": true,
          "isComplete": true,
          "toolSpecificData": {
            "kind": "terminal",
            "language": "sh",
            "command": "ls -la ~/Android/Sdk/platform-tools/adb"
          },
          "toolCallId": "4e57d62a-f132-46bd-8caa-de3e2ca7bb9d",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "Excellent! The `adb` tool is available. Now I need to set up the environment variables. Let me check your current environment and shell configuration: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/home/junior/Projects/ecodreum/ecodreum-app/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "prepareToolInvocation",
          "toolName": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "kind": "toolInvocationSerialized",
          "invocationMessage": "Using \"Run In Terminal\"",
          "isConfirmed": true,
          "isComplete": true,
          "toolSpecificData": {
            "kind": "terminal",
            "language": "sh",
            "command": "echo $ANDROID_HOME"
          },
          "toolCallId": "4cb19212-9ed1-4b22-ba04-42a48107c5d3",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "The `ANDROID_HOME` environment variable is not set. Let me check your shell configuration files to see where we should add the environment variables: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/home/junior/Projects/ecodreum/ecodreum-app/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "prepareToolInvocation",
          "toolName": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "kind": "toolInvocationSerialized",
          "invocationMessage": "Using \"Run In Terminal\"",
          "isConfirmed": true,
          "isComplete": true,
          "toolSpecificData": {
            "kind": "terminal",
            "language": "sh",
            "command": "ls -la ~/.zshrc ~/.bashrc ~/.profile 2>/dev/null || echo \"Some files may not exist\""
          },
          "toolCallId": "e81747e1-0bec-40fc-8abd-de2271539ece",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "Great! You have a `.zshrc` file. Let me check its contents to see if there are already Android-related environment variables: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/home/junior/Projects/ecodreum/ecodreum-app/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "prepareToolInvocation",
          "toolName": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "kind": "toolInvocationSerialized",
          "invocationMessage": "Using \"Run In Terminal\"",
          "isConfirmed": true,
          "isComplete": true,
          "toolSpecificData": {
            "kind": "terminal",
            "language": "sh",
            "command": "grep -i android ~/.zshrc || echo \"No Android configuration found in .zshrc\""
          },
          "toolCallId": "290af285-2bb1-4795-b50f-4f1fd84136af",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "Now I'll add the necessary Android environment variables to your `.zshrc` file. This will set up `ANDROID_HOME` and add the Android tools to your PATH: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/home/junior/Projects/ecodreum/ecodreum-app/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "prepareToolInvocation",
          "toolName": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "kind": "toolInvocationSerialized",
          "invocationMessage": "Using \"Run In Terminal\"",
          "isConfirmed": true,
          "isComplete": true,
          "toolSpecificData": {
            "kind": "terminal",
            "language": "sh",
            "command": "echo '\n# Android SDK Configuration\nexport ANDROID_HOME=$HOME/Android/Sdk\nexport PATH=$PATH:$ANDROID_HOME/emulator\nexport PATH=$PATH:$ANDROID_HOME/platform-tools\nexport PATH=$PATH:$ANDROID_HOME/tools\nexport PATH=$PATH:$ANDROID_HOME/tools/bin' >> ~/.zshrc"
          },
          "toolCallId": "0a65f57d-5fdc-4635-bd68-e77e56577f95",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "Now let's reload the shell configuration to apply the changes: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/home/junior/Projects/ecodreum/ecodreum-app/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "prepareToolInvocation",
          "toolName": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "kind": "toolInvocationSerialized",
          "invocationMessage": "Using \"Run In Terminal\"",
          "isConfirmed": true,
          "isComplete": true,
          "toolSpecificData": {
            "kind": "terminal",
            "language": "sh",
            "command": "source ~/.zshrc"
          },
          "toolCallId": "e9670c09-cb1f-4dc5-9627-c52fe70d06f9",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "Let's verify that the environment variables are now set correctly: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/home/junior/Projects/ecodreum/ecodreum-app/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "prepareToolInvocation",
          "toolName": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "kind": "toolInvocationSerialized",
          "invocationMessage": "Using \"Run In Terminal\"",
          "isConfirmed": true,
          "isComplete": true,
          "toolSpecificData": {
            "kind": "terminal",
            "language": "sh",
            "command": "echo \"ANDROID_HOME: $ANDROID_HOME\" && which adb"
          },
          "toolCallId": "ca000eb3-9f28-49d9-8072-953bfad65688",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "Perfect! The environment variables are now set correctly. Let's test that `adb` is working: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
