          "toolCallId": "e9639a02-5550-40db-890c-aeab66f9ba2f",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "Excellent! Now `adb` is working. Before running the Expo command again, let's make sure you have an Android device connected or an emulator running. Let's check for connected devices: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
