          "isConfirmed": true,
          "isComplete": true,
          "toolSpecificData": {
            "kind": "terminal",
            "language": "sh",
            "command": "adb devices"
          },
          "toolCallId": "775680c4-6448-4b98-a466-5ee6a03aef9a",
          "toolId": "copilot_runInTerminal"
        },
        {
          "value": "No devices are currently connected. You have a few options:\n\n1. **Connect a physical Android device via USB** (enable USB debugging in developer options)\n2. **Start an Android emulator**\n\nLet me check if you have any Android Virtual Devices (AVDs) configured: ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
